  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Specialist Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this deployment is to provide technical MHPSS expertise in Islamabad, Pakistan, including support to the coordination of the MHPSS response to the Pakistan flood emergency. This includes capacity strengthening to facilitate effective coordination, mapping of MHPSS services in the affected provinces, and facilitate MHPSS trainings based on need identified.</narrative>
  </description>
